{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive while the promise is broken</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by the echo of his deceased son, Joseph, a guilt-ridden father, clings to the only penance left: to complete the masterpiece the boy left unfinished. It's not a painting or a poem, but a complex artifact, a marvel of gears and dreams the two of them were meant to build together now you you need to Escape and Survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search and Build the Artifact Pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by the memory of a broken promise from their last conversation, Joseph must embark on a journey to build and find the Artiface Pieces through the places that shaped his son's life. Each component\u2014from a clockwork heart to the wings of memory\u2014 unlocks a painful memory and a truth about the genius he never understood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look around and solve the mysteries and puzzles, and as the artifact takes shape, Joseph will discover that he's not simply building a machine. He's rebuilding, piece by piece, the bond his own words broke, in a desperate search for forgiveness he can no longer ask for. It's a story about how sometimes, to let go of a ghost, we must first learn to build its dream.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Lost Memory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/b5abc8bcccfb83439502a5bd53e47f1f8bc31c62.jpg"},{"name":"First Key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/c61c0f5ef37e922753dcdbf585cf690db90d9ec6.jpg"},{"name":"Key Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/2cd72b0f9bfb362b1afb39cc7bc7bfe8fb2fbcba.jpg"},{"name":"Workshop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/1d5271612fb1f41a3315f3f04f3238cf0e812a11.jpg"},{"name":"Wings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/c9fb2288034e802b2efdbba9f20962336268dc3f.jpg"},{"name":"Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/fbee1af8f5c626c6a2814b3f74e7497986fdb4b1.jpg"},{"name":"Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/73d0e8b21a5429f2d7d48fdedff7b4e1f468683d.jpg"},{"name":"Locker Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/0d7993deedebf0623939a33baa6303a22efe7daf.jpg"},{"name":"Wing Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/1e1d3115429a8b707cd02ad59d9efcb8b52ae3ad.jpg"},{"name":"Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4023030/e521b45f95f717022489f3d19be00a2722ef7725.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023030?t=1764804844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023030?t=1764804844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023030/b80430ec96522dfe3ad5368e6823aef3186a67f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764804844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023030/b80430ec96522dfe3ad5368e6823aef3186a67f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764804844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive while the promise is broken</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by the echo of his deceased son, Joseph, a guilt-ridden father, clings to the only penance left: to complete the masterpiece the boy left unfinished. It's not a painting or a poem, but a complex artifact, a marvel of gears and dreams the two of them were meant to build together now you you need to Escape and Survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search and Build the Artifact Pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by the memory of a broken promise from their last conversation, Joseph must embark on a journey to build and find the Artiface Pieces through the places that shaped his son's life. Each component\u2014from a clockwork heart to the wings of memory\u2014 unlocks a painful memory and a truth about the genius he never understood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look around and solve the mysteries and puzzles, and as the artifact takes shape, Joseph will discover that he's not simply building a machine. He's rebuilding, piece by piece, the bond his own words broke, in a desperate search for forgiveness he can no longer ask for. It's a story about how sometimes, to let go of a ghost, we must first learn to build its dream.</p>","developers":["El Abrigo de Paulo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023030/cff76ac7282da07d29580612524560db5614d4ff/header.jpg?t=1764804844","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4023030/410384895/54b4123fdd3aa69c4ff43c71383d774c1250fc90/1759009935/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759542917","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4023030/410384895/54b4123fdd3aa69c4ff43c71383d774c1250fc90/1759009935/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759542917","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.st